@startuml 1
title SysMon - User Account State Diagram

[*] --> Creating : Admin submits new user

state Creating
state Active
state DeletionPending
state Deleted

Creating --> Active : Account created\nwith no permissions
Creating --> [*] : Creation fails

Active --> Active : updateTier(newTier)
Active --> Active : Grant or revoke permissions

Active --> DeletionPending : Admin selects Delete User

DeletionPending --> Active : Admin cancels
DeletionPending --> Active : Password verification fails
DeletionPending --> Deleted : Password verified\nand deletion confirmed

Deleted --> [*]

@enduml
